    turnFlow: 'Remove one queen to start the tableau. As further queens appear during the deal, each starts a new column. Place all fives and sixes to the foundations when available; build fives downward to aces and kings, and sixes upward to jacks, regardless of suit. Move top cards from tableau and stock to legal foundation positions.',
